# PlayCanvas 引擎

[![NPM 版本](https://img.shields.io/npm/v/playcanvas)](https://www.npmjs.com/package/playcanvas)
[![NPM 下载量](https://img.shields.io/npm/dw/playcanvas)](https://npmtrends.com/playcanvas)
[![许可证](https://img.shields.io/npm/l/playcanvas)](https://github.com/playcanvas/engine/blob/main/LICENSE)
[![Discord](https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-5865F2?style=flat&logo=discord&logoColor=white&color=black)](https://discord.gg/RSaMRzg)
